{"id":"corte","lemma":"corte","pos":"noun","rank":701,"glosses":["cut (the act of cutting)","cut (the result of cutting)","cut (an opening resulting from cutting; an incision or wound)"],"ipa":"/ˈkoɾte/","gender":"m","forms":{"plural":"cortes"},"audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/e/e2/LL-Q1321_%28spa%29-Marreromarco-corte.wav","formAudio":{"cortes":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/b/b4/LL-Q1321_%28spa%29-Wikipedian-walker-cortes.wav"},"examples":[{"text":"Tom está en la corte.","en":"Tom is in court.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/800265"},{"text":"Cuidado, no te cortes.","en":"Be careful. Don't cut yourself.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/797991"},{"text":"Necesitas un corte de pelo.","en":"You need a haircut.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/43983"},{"text":"No te cortes el dedo.","en":"Don't cut your finger.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/453222"},{"text":"Te veré en la corte.","en":"I'll see you in court.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/454899"}]}